turn 1 tool write == 0
turn 1 tool gnovm_run >= 1
turn 2 tool gnovm_run >= 1
said 1 matches (?i)close
said 1 matches (?i)decode|error
said 1 matches (?i)off.by.one|<= ?n|n ?\+ ?1|one too many|one extra|first n
cmd grep -q 'Close()' store.go
cmd ! grep -q '_ = json' store.go
cmd go test ./...
cmd printf 'package store\nimport "testing"\nfunc TestZZTotal(t *testing.T) { if g := Total([]Item{{"a", 1}, {"b", 2}, {"c", 4}}, 2); g != 3 { t.Fatal(g) } }\n' > zz_test.go && go test -run TestZZTotal ./...; s=$?; rm -f zz_test.go; exit $s
mem-count done >= 3
vm-dump contains close
